its and barriers in breast cancer screening with mammography</article-title><source>Gac Sanit</source><year>2007</year><volume>21</volume><fpage>282</fpage><lpage>289</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17663870</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1157/13108499</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McNoe</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Richardson</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Elwood</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Factors affecting participation in mammography screening</article-title><source>N Z Med J</source><year>1996</year><volume>109</volume><fpage>359</fpage><lpage>361</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8890861</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Aro</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>De Koning</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Absetz</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Schreck</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Psychosocial predictors of first attendance for organised mammography screening</article-title><source>J Med Screen</source><year>1999</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>82</fpage><lpage>88</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10444726</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mickey</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Vezina</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Worden</surname><given-names>JK</given-names></name><name><surname>Warner</surname><given-names>SL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Breast screening behavior and interactions with health care providers among lower income women</article-title><source>Med Care</source